{"id":"vod_md_5753","vodId":"5753","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"美少女战士","name_cn":"美少女战士","date":"1992-01-01","year":"1992","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"46集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231011-1/4ceab9d5b323f29f336e48d4d267ac0c.jpg"},"summary":"美丽可爱的月野兔（三石琴乃 配音）是一名正救读初中的女孩，她学业平平，任性娇弱，俨然是生活在大都会普普通通的女孩子们中的平凡一员。可是，在遇到了那只会说话的小猫露娜之后，月野的人生发生天翻地覆的变化。她不仅可以变身成为拥有神奇能力的水手月亮，还渐渐知晓了自己前世今生的秘密。为了保卫地球，挫败黑暗帝国的野心，月野和水野亚美（久川绫 配音）、火野丽（富泽美智惠 配音）、木野真琴（篠原惠美 配音）、爱野美奈子（深见梨加 配音）等人结成美少女战士，与罪恶展开了连番激战，在此过程中，她与命中注定的爱人地场卫（古谷彻 配音）的浪漫恋情也悄然上演……本片根据漫画家武内直子的经典同名原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动作,爱情,动画,惊悚,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-11 07:49:49","classic":true,"classicRank":44,"franchise":"美少女战士","playable":true,"episodeCount":46,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/MHmBWqG1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/fU3cszlx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/qWg8Fn7p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/5mMDMA82/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/eqfWLpPI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/n9KLVybW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/93PjTfQn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/lMfol7tX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/WVIW0juM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/qj4YysGc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/3drEsz8V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/uRmh0Fc0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/x2QPpX9f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/LkQPiRCm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://pl